rity-model-gpt-5-6-cyber/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SecurityWeek</a>, <a href="https://thehackernews.com/2026/08/openai-launches-gpt-56-cyber-with.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Hacker News</a> and <a href="https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/08/11/openai-gpt-5-6-cyber-model/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Help Net Security</a>. The benchmark figures are OpenAI's own evaluation.</p>
